OL,3,GNEWSAHistory-based theme park's        
OL,4,Atransport plans backed                 
OL,6,FHighways bosses have backed the        
OL,7,Ftransport strategy for a proposed new  
OL,8,Ftheme park, ahead of an expected       
OL,9,Fdecision on the plans later this month.
OL,11,FFrench firm Puy du Fou submitted       
OL,12,Fproposals to build the history-based   
OL,13,Famusement park on land north of        
OL,14,FBicester last year.                    
OL,16,FNational Highways and Oxfordshire      
OL,17,FCounty Council now support the         
OL,18,Fcompany's travel plan for the area,    
OL,19,Fmeaning the project can be considered  
OL,20,Fby Cherwell District Council's planning
OL,21,Fcommittee.                             
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
