OL,4,Atransport plans backed                 
OL,6,FA decision had previously been         
OL,7,Fscheduled to be made by the end of     
OL,8,FNovember, with local campaigners urging
OL,9,Fthe authority to reject the            
OL,10,Fdevelopment.                           
